    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   This rock...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "This rock..."
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   Stay close to me, you two. Watch your step, and stay inside my footprints. Don't go around touching things either.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "Stay close to me, you two. Watch your step, and stay inside my footprints. Don't go around touching things either."
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   I'm afraid this forest is even more dangerous than we suspected.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "I'm afraid this forest is even more dangerous than we suspected."
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_220_grani#3\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#3"
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   Is something carved on that rock?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "Is something carved on that rock?"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010\",name2=\"char_220_grani#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   These are marks left behind by bounty hunters. We need to take heed of these, or we may well end up stepping in a trap.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "These are marks left behind by bounty hunters. We need to take heed of these, or we may well end up stepping in a trap."
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010\",name2=\"char_220_grani#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   So, how are we going to avoid the traps?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "So, how are we going to avoid the traps?"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010"
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   Just watch me.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "Just watch me."
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   An animal trap on a rope... how old-fashioned.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "An animal trap on a rope... how old-fashioned."
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[Blocker(a=1, r=0,g=0, b=0, fadetime=1.5, block=true)]",
        "type": "blocker",
        "a": "1,",
        "r": "0,g=0,",
        "b": "0,",
        "fadetime": "1.5,",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[Blocker(a=0, fadetime=1.5, block=true)]",
        "type": "blocker",
        "a": "0,",
        "fadetime": "1.5,",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010"
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   Here's a rolling log trap, hidden by the foliage. Would've tripped it if we rushed forward.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "Here's a rolling log trap, hidden by the foliage. Would've tripped it if we rushed forward."
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   Miss Carol, watch your step.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "Miss Carol, watch your step."
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010\",name2=\"avg_npc_003\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   Uh, huh?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "Uh, huh?"
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010\",name2=\"avg_npc_003\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   If you take another step in that direction, there's probably a spiked pitfall waiting for you.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "If you take another step in that direction, there's probably a spiked pitfall waiting for you."
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010\",name2=\"avg_npc_003\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   Oh...!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "Oh...!"
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_220_grani#3\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#3"
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   You sure are the real deal. You're pretty good at this.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "You sure are the real deal. You're pretty good at this."
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010"
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   Of course. After all, I used to...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "Of course. After all, I used to..."
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   ...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "..."
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   It's not realistic to go around all the traps. Looks like we'll have to disarm some of them after all.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "It's not realistic to go around all the traps. Looks like we'll have to disarm some of them after all."
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   The most perilous path for them will soon become the safest path for us.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "The most perilous path for them will soon become the safest path for us."
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   Let's go.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "Let's go."
    },
